json5/number
description: Number in either the JSON spelling or the eigen JSON5 one
- >
  A JSON5 number is written in either of two spellings — the JSON one or the eigen JSON5 one:
- !!<format: text/x-json5> |
  42   -0.5   0x2A   .5   Infinity
- >
  See the subchapters below for the two spellings:
- *..:..:..:04-json_code:01-json_scalar:01-json_number
- *: 01-json5_eigen_number
